# GeneralsX @build Claude 19/08/2026 Keep the build context for Dockerfile.dev tiny.
#
# resources/dockerbuild/compose.dev.yml builds with the repository ROOT as its context,
# and the repository is ~500k LOC plus references/ and build/. Dockerfile.dev deliberately
# COPYs nothing but the vcpkg dependency manifests - the checkout itself is bind-mounted at
# runtime - so everything else is excluded here.
#
# This only affects builds whose context is the repository root. The older images
# (Dockerfile.linux, Dockerfile.mingw, Dockerfile) are built by
# scripts/env/docker/docker-build-images.sh with resources/dockerbuild/ as their context
# and are unaffected.
*
!vcpkg.json
!vcpkg-lock.json
!triplets
